       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI55506.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI55506.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Detalhe da Linha do Extracto                               *
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI55506         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
AG         EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8201 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5550.
       COPY SWCV5551.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0010.
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5808                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5808'.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
AG         05 CON-SWVT8201                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.
AG         05 CON-DOIS-PONTOS              PIC  X(01) VALUE ':'.
           05 CON-O00                      PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.

AG    *--------------------------------------------------------------
|     *            VARIAVEIS
|     *--------------------------------------------------------------
|      01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
|          05 WS-CNATREC-SWT58             PIC  X(03) VALUE SPACES.
|          05 WS-CNATREC-SWT72             PIC  X(03) VALUE SPACES.
|          05 WS-RELACAO-SWT58             PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACES.
|          05 WS-RELACAO-SWT72             PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACES.
|          05 WS-COUNT-SWT58               PIC S9(01) COMP-3.
AG         05 WS-COUNT-SWT72               PIC S9(01) COMP-3.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME     PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI55506'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI55506         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5550-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5550-ASE               TO SWCV5551-ASE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5550-ADE               TO SWCV5551-ADE.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2199-VALIDACOES-EXIT

AG         IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
|             PERFORM 2300-INSERE-SWT82
|                THRU 2399-INSERE-SWT82-EXIT
AG         END-IF.

AG         IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
|             PERFORM 2400-CALCULA-CNATREC
|                THRU 2499-CALCULA-CNATREC-EXIT
AG         END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-MODIFICA-DADOS
                 THRU 2299-MODIFICA-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
AG    *
|          PERFORM 2110-VALIDA-IDRECON
AG            THRU 2110-VALIDA-IDRECON-EXIT.
      *
       2199-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
AG    *--------------------------------------------------------------
|     *                   2110-VALIDA-IDRECON
|     *--------------------------------------------------------------
|      2110-VALIDA-IDRECON.
|     *
|          IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
|             MOVE '2110-VALIDA-IDRECON' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
|             PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
|                THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
|          END-IF.
|     *
|          MOVE SWCV5550-COSN              TO SWCD5808-COSN.
|          MOVE SWCV5550-COSNC             TO SWCD5808-COSNC.
|     *
|          EXEC SQL
|             SELECT IDRECONC
|               INTO :SWCD5808-IDRECONC
|               FROM SWVT5808
|              WHERE (COSN      =  :SWCD5808-COSN
|                AND  COSNC     =  :SWCD5808-COSNC)
|          END-EXEC.
|
|          MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
|
|          PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
|             THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
|
|     *
           MOVE SWCV5550-CCODMSG           TO SWCD5808-CCODMSG
                                              SWCD7204-CCODMSG.
           MOVE SWCV5550-DATVAL            TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5808-DATVAL
                                              SWCD7204-DATVAL.
           MOVE SWCV5550-COSN              TO SWCD5808-COSN
                                              SWCD7204-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV5550-COSNC             TO SWCD5808-COSNC
                                              SWCD7204-COSNC.
           MOVE SWCV5550-CREF              TO SWCD5808-CREF
                                              SWCD7204-CREF.
           MOVE SWCV5550-CREFOPR           TO SWCD5808-CREFOPR
                                              SWCD7204-CREFOPR.
AG    *    MOVE SWCK0002-CODEST-RECO       TO SWCD5808-CCODEST.
AG         MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-SUGERIDA   TO SWCD5808-CCODEST.

           MOVE SWCV5551-MRNOPRX           TO SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                                              SWCD5808-NOPRREC.
           MOVE SWCV5551-MRNORDX           TO SWCD7204-MRNORD
                                              SWCD5808-NORDREC.
           MOVE SWCK0002-IRECONC-SIM       TO SWCD7204-IRECONC.
           MOVE SWCV5550-OBSER             TO SWCD5808-OBSER.
           MOVE SWCK0002-CTIPREC-M         TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                                              SWCD5808-CTIPREC.
           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD5808-CUSERID
                                              SWCD7204-CUSERID.

           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5808-DATREC.

AG         MOVE SWCD5808-IDRECONC          TO SWCD5808-IDRECONC
AG                                            SWCD7204-IDRECONC.

PML24      MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD5808-CNIVREC
PML24                                         SWCD7204-CNIVREC.

       2110-VALIDA-IDRECON-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2200-MODIFICA-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-MODIFICA-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-MODIFICA-DADOS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 2210-MODIFICA-SWT58
              THRU 2219-MODIFICA-SWT58-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2220-MODIFICA-SWT72
                 THRU 2229-MODIFICA-SWT72-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2299-MODIFICA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2210-MODIFICA-SWT58
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2210-MODIFICA-SWT58.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2210-MODIFICA-SWT58' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT5808
AG               SET IDRECONC =  :SWCD5808-IDRECONC
                   , DATREC   =  :SWCD5808-DATREC
                   , CCODEST  =  :SWCD5808-CCODEST
PML24              , CNIVREC  =  :SWCD5808-CNIVREC
                   , CTIPREC  =  :SWCD5808-CTIPREC
AG                 , CNATREC  =  :SWCD5808-CNATREC
                   , CUSERID  =  :SWCD5808-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE COSN     =  :SWCD5808-COSN
                 AND COSNC    =  :SWCD5808-COSNC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-DATVAL-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSN-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSNC-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CREF-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-CAPLIC
              ELSE
                 IF NOT DB2-OK
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
           END-IF.

       2219-MODIFICA-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2220-MODIFICA-SWT72
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2220-MODIFICA-SWT72.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2220-MODIFICA-SWT72' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
AG               SET IDRECONC =  :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , CCODMSG  =  :SWCD7204-CCODMSG
                   , DATVAL   =  :SWCD7204-DATVAL
                   , CREF     =  :SWCD7204-CREF
                   , CREFOPR  =  :SWCD7204-CREFOPR
                   , CTIPREC  =  :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                   , CUSERID  =  :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
AG                 , CNATREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNATREC
PML24              , CNIVREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNIVREC
               WHERE MRNOPR   =  :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD   =  :SWCD7204-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-DATVAL-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSN-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSNC-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CREF-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-CAPLIC
              ELSE
                 IF NOT DB2-OK
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
           END-IF.

       2229-MODIFICA-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

AG    *--------------------------------------------------------------
|     *                   2300-INSERE-SWT82
|     *--------------------------------------------------------------
|      2300-INSERE-SWT82.
|          IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
|             MOVE '2300-INSERE-SWT82  '   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
|             PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
|                THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
|          END-IF.
|
|          MOVE SWCD5808-IDRECONC          TO SWCD8201-IDRECONC.
|
|          EXEC SQL
|             SELECT NSEQ
|               INTO :SWCD8201-NSEQ
|               FROM SWVT8201
|              WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
|              ORDER BY NSEQ DESC
|              LIMIT 1
|          END-EXEC.
|
|          MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
|
|          PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
|             THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
|
|          IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
|             IF DB2-OK
|                ADD 1                     TO SWCD8201-NSEQ
|             ELSE
|                IF DB2-NOTFND
|                   MOVE 1                 TO SWCD8201-NSEQ
|                ELSE
|                   MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
|                                          TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|                   MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
|                                          TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
|                END-IF
|             END-IF
|          END-IF.
|
|          MOVE SWCD7204-MRNOPR            TO SWCD8201-MRNOPR.
|          MOVE SWCD7204-MRNORD            TO SWCD8201-MRNORD.
|          MOVE SWCD5808-COSN              TO SWCD8201-COSN.
|          MOVE SWCD5808-COSNC             TO SWCD8201-COSNC.
|          MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD8201-CUSERID.
|
|          MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO SWCD8201-DATREC.
|
|          EXEC SQL
|             INSERT INTO SWVT8201
|                  ( IDRECONC
|                  , NSEQ
|                  , MRNOPR
|                  , MRNORD
|                  , COSN
|                  , COSNC
|                  , DATREC
|                  , CUSERID
|                  , HTIMEST )
|           VALUES ( :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
|                  , :SWCD8201-NSEQ
|                  , :SWCD8201-MRNOPR
|                  , :SWCD8201-MRNORD
|                  , :SWCD8201-COSN
|                  , :SWCD8201-COSNC
|                  , :SWCD8201-DATREC
|                  , :SWCD8201-CUSERID
|                  , CURRENT TIMESTAMP )
|          END-EXEC.
|
|          MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
|
|          PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
|             THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
|
|          IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
|             IF NOT DB2-OK
|                MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|                MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2    TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
|     *       END-IF
|     *    ELSE
|     *       MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|     *       MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2       TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
|          END-IF.
|
|      2399-INSERE-SWT82-EXIT.
AG         EXIT.

AG    *--------------------------------------------------------------
|     *                   2400-CALCULA-CNATREC
|     *--------------------------------------------------------------
|      2400-CALCULA-CNATREC.
|          IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
|             MOVE '2400-CALCULA-CNATREC'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
|             PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
|                THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
|          END-IF.
|
|          MOVE SWCD5808-IDRECONC          TO SWCD8201-IDRECONC
|
|          EXEC SQL
|             SELECT COUNT(COSN)
|               INTO :WS-COUNT-SWT58
|               FROM SWVT8201
|              WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
|                AND COSN     <> " "
|                AND COSNC    <> " "
|          END-EXEC.
|
|          MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
|
|          PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
|             THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
|
|          IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
|             IF NOT DB2-OK
|                MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
|                                          TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|                MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
|                                          TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
|             END-IF
|          END-IF.
|
|          EXEC SQL
|             SELECT COUNT(MRNOPR)
|               INTO :WS-COUNT-SWT72
|               FROM SWVT8201
|              WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
|                AND MRNOPR   <> 0
|                AND MRNORD   <> 0
|          END-EXEC.
|
|          MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
|
|          PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
|             THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
|
|          IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
|             IF NOT DB2-OK
|                MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
|                                          TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|                MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
|                                          TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
|             END-IF
|          END-IF.
|
|          IF WS-COUNT-SWT58 EQUAL 1
|             MOVE '1'                     TO WS-RELACAO-SWT58
|          ELSE
|             IF WS-COUNT-SWT58 > 1
|                MOVE 'N'                  TO WS-RELACAO-SWT58
|             ELSE
|                MOVE '0'                  TO WS-RELACAO-SWT58
|             END-IF
|          END-IF.
|
|          IF WS-COUNT-SWT72 EQUAL 1
|             MOVE '1'                     TO WS-RELACAO-SWT72
|          ELSE
|             IF WS-COUNT-SWT72 > 1
|                MOVE 'N'                  TO WS-RELACAO-SWT72
|             ELSE
|                MOVE '0'                  TO WS-RELACAO-SWT72
|             END-IF
|          END-IF.
|
|          MOVE WS-RELACAO-SWT58           TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(1:1).
|          MOVE CON-DOIS-PONTOS            TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(2:1).
|          MOVE WS-RELACAO-SWT72           TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(3:1).
|
|          MOVE WS-RELACAO-SWT72           TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(1:1).
|          MOVE CON-DOIS-PONTOS            TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(2:1).
|          MOVE WS-RELACAO-SWT58           TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(3:1).
|
|          MOVE  WS-CNATREC-SWT58          TO SWCD5808-CNATREC.
|          MOVE  WS-CNATREC-SWT72          TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.
|
|      2499-CALCULA-CNATREC-EXIT.
AG         EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5551-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5551-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5551-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0010.
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY AQCP0005.
